            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
        <figcaption>The blind test, with the logo hidden: the average price people expected for the same fleece jacket, and the brands they named most. People could name more than one brand.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="prose-narrow result-after">
        <p>I left VF before development finished, so I don’t have launch numbers. But the redesign is live on thenorthface.com today, built from these designs.</p>
        <p>The design system made an impact on the internal design teams right away. The North Face is the only brand that adopted it, though. White-labeling it for other VF brands was always the goal, but it didn’t happen while I was there.</p>
