      <h2 id="next-title" class="claim"><span class="visually-hidden">Looking back: </span>1,200 symbols in Sketch. Never again.</h2>
      <div class="prose reflection">
        <p>Overall, I’m very proud of this project, but the tools are so much better now. Building a design system this big in Sketch came with a lot of limits, and I can only imagine how the team has improved it since. Figma and today’s AI tools would have made the whole project far more efficient.</p>
        <p>On the ideas side, I wish I’d pushed a little harder for UX improvements alongside the visual ones. In a market as competitive as e-commerce, every little bit matters.</p>
